# LLM Assist — editor selection contract

The **「선택된 텍스트」** field in `LlmAssistPanel` must stay in sync with the active markdown editor, including after focus moves to the LLM panel / dock / popout chrome.

**Apply / insert** must target the **last source-Editor caret or selection**, not the live CM selection while focus is outside the source pane (panel, other split leaf, etc.).

## Single source of truth

| Layer | Module | Responsibility |
|-------|--------|----------------|
| Read / replace | `src/utils/editorSelection.ts` | `getEditorSelectionFromRef`, `subscribeEditorSelectionFromRef`, `applyLlmResultToEditor` |
| Focus memory | `src/utils/mdEditorSourceFocus.ts` | Last source-Editor caret/selection (view WeakMap + durable `storageType:path`) |
| Host state | `src/components/llm/LlmAssistModal.tsx` | `selectedText`, `refreshSelection`, subscription lifecycle |
| Bridge | `MarkdownEditor.jsx` / demoted `EditorPane` + `LlmAssistSessionContext` | `registerEditorBridge({ editorRef, onChange, getMarkdown, documentKey })` |

Do **not** read CodeMirror selection inline in panel/modal code. Always go through `editorSelection.ts`.

## Read / apply order

1. If source CM **has keyboard focus** → use live selection.
2. Else → use `resolveMdEditorSourceFocus(view, documentKey)` (view map, then durable key).
3. Collapsed caret insert uses last-focus caret (not doc end) when `everFocused`.
4. Preview-only / never focused / `forceAppendAtEnd` → append at document end.
5. Demoted pane (no view) → durable range + `getMarkdown`/`onChange` string splice.

## Host wiring checklist

1. Active `MarkdownEditor` registers `registerEditorBridge` when `isActiveFile && !previewOnly` (including frozen settle before demote).
2. Demoted `EditorPane` registers a content-only bridge with `documentKey` + `getMarkdown`/`onChange`.
3. `AppLayout` must pass `isActiveFile` into `editorPaneProps` (keep-alive tabs).
4. Bridge includes `getEditorApi()` and `documentKey` when available.
5. `LlmAssistModal` resolves `editorRef` from `session.editorBridge` and passes `documentKey` into apply/read.
6. On open / bridge change → `refreshSelection()`; while open → `subscribeEditorSelectionFromRef` + polling fallback.
7. Docked mode must not leave `hidden=true` from floating minimize (blocks selection sync).
8. `refreshSelection` must **not** clear `selectedText` when `editorRef` is temporarily missing.
9. Popout sync includes `selectedText` + `selectionRange` from the same helpers.

## Subscription implementation

`subscribeEditorSelectionFromRef` must attach CodeMirror listeners with **`StateEffect.appendConfig.of(compartment.of(...))`** on first attach, then `compartment.reconfigure(...)` on later updates. Never call `reconfigure` on a compartment that is not yet in editor state.

## Tests required when touching this area

Update `tests/utils/editorSelection.test.ts` (and `mdEditorSourceFocus.test.ts` if apply behavior changes):

- live CM selection when source focused
- panel focus → last-focus range for read and apply
- durable key survives view teardown (demote)
- live selection preferred over focus history only while source has focus
- subscribe retry until view mounts

```text
❌ BAD — apply uses live collapsed selection after panel steals focus
❌ BAD — demote clears focus with no durable documentKey map
❌ BAD — LlmAssistModal reads editorRef.current.getEditorView() directly
✅ GOOD — applyLlmResultToEditor + resolveMdEditorSourceFocus + documentKey
✅ GOOD — attachMdEditorSourceFocusTracking(view, documentKey)
```

Prefer **English** in new code comments if Korean Unicode might corrupt.
